README for the TeraGrid build
Written by Marek Korkusinski, marekk@purdue.edu, Nov. 2, 2004.

I have built the NEMO_3D package on TeraGrid using the setting
BUILD_TYPE = itanium2_intel8_mpi_static
in the make.inc file.

My builds were done from the TeraGrid login node
tg-login1.ncsa.teragrid.org
The TeraGrid cluster does not seem to have the necessary libraries 
in the default paths, so I enabled them by adding a few lines into
the make.inc file (to find the spot, just look for the string "tg-login1").

As it is now, the build should proceed *fully automatically* on the login 
node tg-login1 --- just set the XERCESC environment variable to
<path_to_NEMO>/NEMO_3D/xerces-c-src2_1_0    
and then execute 
<path_to_NEMO>/NEMO_3D/build/make


If you are using a different login host (e.g., tg-login2), 
please adjust the host name in the file make.inc, 
and proceed with the build as described above.
